  The ⟦f:principal-keys⟧three ⟦/f⟧act kinds and what they may do: room acts, principal acts and their classes, ⟦f:principal-keys⟧expire acts, ⟦/f⟧roles, ⟦f:moderation⟧appointments, ⟦/f⟧⟦f:work-rooms⟧joins, ⟦/f⟧⟦f:moderation⟧moderation, ⟦/f⟧⟦f:ownership-transfer⟧handover, ⟦/f⟧⟦f:stamps⟧stamps ⟦/f⟧and the room merge.
